    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50737" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vestītor</span></b> , ōris,
			m.
		vestio. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A maker of clothing</i>, <i>tailor</i> (post-class.), <i><span class="en">Lampr. Alex. Sev.
				41</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Inscr. Grut. 1111, 3</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">Inscr. Murat. 1842,
			2</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A clother</i>, <i>dresser</i>:
			divinorum simulacrorum, Firm. Math. 3, 11, 9.</div>
